like this:

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:22.320
A cup of warm water is suspended in a large
pot of water held at a steady boil.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:23.980
Will the water in the cup ever boil?

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:24.980
Yes, no, or it’s impossible to say.

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:27.500
Assume the large pot never runs out of water.

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:30.089
The answer is that it will never boil.

00:13:30.089 --> 00:13:36.200
As the cup of water heats up to 100°C in
the boiling pot, heat flow stops since both

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:38.630
are at the same temperature.

